WEBVTT

00:11.960 --> 00:13.150
What was that for?

00:13.380 --> 00:15.110
Where do you think you're going?

00:15.590 --> 00:17.340
I can't wait any longer!

00:17.340 --> 00:19.740
If you're not going to go, then I will!

00:19.740 --> 00:21.590
I didn't say I wasn't going.

00:21.590 --> 00:24.960
You're not even an apprentice,
what are you going to do there?

00:25.390 --> 00:26.620
What do you think?

00:26.620 --> 00:28.420
After all, I'm Iria, Glen's assistant!

00:29.810 --> 00:31.760
You know what to do?

00:33.230 --> 00:34.260
Fine, let's go!

00:35.080 --> 00:37.010
Hey, wait!

00:38.580 --> 00:39.220
Glen!

00:39.640 --> 00:41.180
Iria, get out of here!

00:41.470 --> 00:43.140
I can take him out from here!

00:43.420 --> 00:45.230
Don't be stupid, get away!

00:45.680 --> 00:48.110
I'm not leaving without you!

00:54.240 --> 00:57.410
Glen!

01:08.780 --> 01:10.710
Iria! Are you okay?

01:11.080 --> 01:12.270
I'm fine.

01:12.270 --> 01:14.870
You were unconscious for five days.

01:14.870 --> 01:16.680
I thought you might die...

01:17.280 --> 01:18.440
What's this for?

01:18.440 --> 01:20.640
I just overslept a bit.

01:50.890 --> 01:51.920
<i>Shoot me!</i>

01:54.660 --> 01:56.880
<i>Hurry!</i>

02:39.800 --> 02:47.200
<i>The night sky has betrayed the stars...</i>

02:50.310 --> 02:57.850
<i>A faraway cry slowly fades.</i>

03:00.780 --> 03:11.270
<i>The sun has disappeared...</i>

03:11.270 --> 03:21.330
<i>and my heart is alone
with the revelation.</i>

03:24.390 --> 03:32.410
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

03:34.860 --> 03:43.150
<i>Tempting lost souls.</i>

03:45.280 --> 03:53.270
<i>A stranger's dreams appear.</i>

03:51.290 --> 03:55.190
Iria: Zeiram the Animation

03:55.190 --> 03:58.920
Utopia

04:20.970 --> 04:23.400
Why doesn't it die?

04:23.400 --> 04:24.780
The Madouras were useless...

04:54.410 --> 04:55.340
What's Zeiram doing?

04:55.340 --> 04:57.540
<i>It’s calling for his buddies.</i>

04:57.540 --> 04:59.310
<i>It’s using a special signal.</i>

04:59.310 --> 05:00.680
<i>— Check it out.</i> — Sure.

05:00.680 --> 05:02.830
What's the point?

05:02.830 --> 05:05.080
What can you do, you're injured.

05:05.080 --> 05:06.360
Why do you even ask?

05:06.580 --> 05:09.070
We'll get that monster this time!

05:09.070 --> 05:12.580
I'm prepared. It's time for payback!

05:12.930 --> 05:15.920
You're planning to do
something with that toy?

05:16.160 --> 05:17.930
It's not a toy!

05:17.930 --> 05:19.930
<i>Kei, just calm down.</i>

05:19.930 --> 05:22.260
<i>Iria still needs to rest.</i>

05:22.940 --> 05:25.520
Iria's fine, she's super tough.

05:25.520 --> 05:27.970
She told me she was fine earlier today! Right?

05:28.220 --> 05:30.370
I'm fine all right.

05:30.370 --> 05:32.430
But you need to be good and stay here.

05:33.770 --> 05:36.430
Why even talk about this anymore?

05:36.430 --> 05:39.770
The authorities are gonna blast
'em off into space, I hear.

05:39.770 --> 05:41.070
Using the TransSat network?

05:41.070 --> 05:42.730
Yeah, the whole goddamn thing.

05:43.000 --> 05:45.020
That won't work!

05:45.020 --> 05:47.690
We have to kill it!

05:47.690 --> 05:51.330
Otherwise, it will keep coming back! Right, Iria?

05:51.540 --> 05:53.520
It's pointless.

05:53.520 --> 05:55.290
The authorities made their decision.

05:55.870 --> 05:57.850
Iria...

06:03.580 --> 06:07.470
Sending Zeiram outside
of the system will...

06:07.470 --> 06:10.750
lure the others away from Myce.

06:10.750 --> 06:13.790
However, it won't be
a permanent solution.

06:13.790 --> 06:16.920
Zeiram's already assimilated the
Tanjekabaran, and it's inorganic matter.

06:16.920 --> 06:22.160
It can also withstand
attacks from the Madouradins.

06:22.160 --> 06:26.820
We understand, Dr. Touka, but
we're running out of time.

06:26.820 --> 06:29.410
We'll stick to our plan.

06:29.410 --> 06:32.870
Next time, it could return
with more of its kind.

06:33.380 --> 06:36.920
We'll keep sending them
back into space every time!

06:36.920 --> 06:41.570
We'll even build a custom
teleporter just for them!

06:41.570 --> 06:44.840
Unless you find its
Achilles heel, first.

06:45.830 --> 06:48.590
Drug it and bring it to me!

06:48.590 --> 06:50.300
I'll find its weaknesses!

06:50.760 --> 06:53.780
Would singing a lullaby work?

06:57.730 --> 06:59.440
Now, march forward!

06:59.800 --> 07:00.810
Keep marching!

07:00.810 --> 07:02.750
Surround the area!

07:03.440 --> 07:06.110
Be careful, we have to
protect this at all costs!

07:06.300 --> 07:08.360
<i>Terminal five, mobilised.</i>

07:08.360 --> 07:12.000
<i>Terminal seven, advancing,
no sign of the enemy!</i>

07:12.000 --> 07:15.030
<i>Terminal two, detour,
there’s too much debris.</i>

07:15.030 --> 07:16.040
<i>Terminal eight...</i>

07:16.470 --> 07:17.420
Go get 'em!

07:17.420 --> 07:20.500
We need all of them
to reach maximum power.

07:25.490 --> 07:29.350
<i>Currently, eleven teleportation terminals
are being moved and deployed...</i>

07:29.350 --> 07:34.400
<i>to transit both Zeiram and
the Tanjekabaran into deep space.</i>

07:34.400 --> 07:38.840
<i>The plan is expected to
have a 100% success rate.</i>

07:38.840 --> 07:44.750
<i>They’ve also admitted that restarting
this project will be very difficult.</i>

07:44.750 --> 07:49.040
<i>Zeiram has plunged
the city into chaos.</i>

07:49.040 --> 07:52.860
<i>It is currently classified as a Class A threat
by the Myce Administration.</i>

07:52.860 --> 07:55.960
<i>We know very little
about this creature.</i>

07:55.960 --> 07:59.450
<i>According to recently
declassified records, sixty years ago...</i>

07:59.450 --> 08:04.250
<i>Konnin-Ancho, known for
the Myce ruby, was attacked by...</i>

08:04.860 --> 08:06.680
<i>Terminal one, report.</i>

08:06.680 --> 08:07.210
All clear.

08:07.500 --> 08:09.130
We're almost in range.

08:10.040 --> 08:11.420
We're on schedule.

08:11.420 --> 08:12.630
— They're coming!
— What?

08:30.610 --> 08:31.570
<i>Keep your cool.</i>

08:45.840 --> 08:47.820
<i>You’re so reckless.</i>

08:47.820 --> 08:49.240
<i>Are you okay?</i>

08:49.240 --> 08:50.660
Yeah.

08:51.490 --> 08:54.300
<i>That move won’t work on the real thing.</i>

08:54.860 --> 08:56.870
I know.

08:58.980 --> 09:00.350
Hey Bob?

09:00.350 --> 09:01.130
<i>Yes?</i>

09:01.130 --> 09:03.390
What's Zeiram's weak point?

09:08.090 --> 09:09.820
I just had to ask.

09:10.270 --> 09:14.780
At one point, I would have
fought him without asking that.

09:16.870 --> 09:19.580
I've become a nervous wreck.

09:19.580 --> 09:22.750
<i>No, you’ve learned to be careful. That's good.</i>

09:23.120 --> 09:27.400
I'm still not sure what I should do...

09:28.450 --> 09:30.010
<i>It’s the Kreper!</i>

09:30.010 --> 09:31.890
Hey, is it Fujikuro?

09:31.890 --> 09:33.980
I know you can hear me!

09:33.980 --> 09:35.530
<i>— Sorry!</i>
— Kei!

09:35.530 --> 09:37.430
<i>I’l fill up the tank
before I give it back!</i>

09:37.800 --> 09:38.890
<i>What are you doing?</i>

09:39.060 --> 09:41.760
<i>You can’t fight,
yet, so I’m gonna...</i>

09:41.760 --> 09:43.680
You're gonna what?

09:43.680 --> 09:45.830
<i>I’m gonna fight for you.</i>

09:45.830 --> 09:46.850
Have you lost your mind?

09:47.250 --> 09:49.740
You can't handle him by yourself!

09:49.740 --> 09:51.940
<i>Yeah, but somebody has to go!</i>

09:51.940 --> 09:53.570
Did anybody ask you?

09:53.880 --> 09:55.690
<i>I can’t wait any longer!</i>

09:55.690 --> 09:58.380
<i>If you’re not going to go, then I will!</i>

09:58.380 --> 10:00.030
What on earth can you do?

10:01.150 --> 10:02.700
<i>Where do you think you’re going?</i>

10:03.340 --> 10:04.940
<i>I can’t wait any longer!</i>

10:04.940 --> 10:07.160
<i>If you’re not going to go, then I will!</i>

10:07.160 --> 10:08.210
<i>Later, Iria!</i>

10:12.320 --> 10:14.880
You're still with me...

10:15.430 --> 10:16.380
Glen...

10:18.860 --> 10:19.880
Here we go!

10:25.740 --> 10:26.980
Shoot!

10:27.340 --> 10:31.170
Check the fuel gauge before
you take off, you dummy!

10:31.170 --> 10:32.400
Fujikuro!

10:32.710 --> 10:35.360
That's why I hate amateurs.

10:35.900 --> 10:36.990
What are you doing?

10:37.350 --> 10:39.180
Mind your manners when
you talk to me, kid!

10:39.180 --> 10:41.210
I saved your life!

10:41.210 --> 10:43.080
I didn't ask for it!

10:43.430 --> 10:46.180
You didn't ask for it?

10:47.630 --> 10:48.870
Hey, what are you doing?

10:49.740 --> 10:50.540
Ouch!

10:50.540 --> 10:52.330
Why are you bugging me?

10:52.620 --> 10:55.880
Does that hurt? It hurts even more to get killed.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.460
How do you know?

10:57.460 --> 10:59.300
Have you died before, huh?

10:59.300 --> 11:00.670
You punk!

11:00.670 --> 11:04.010
Stop it, I said it hurts!

11:04.670 --> 11:07.350
The reckless ones are the first to die.

11:07.680 --> 11:10.810
I'm not an idiot, I even
have a secret weapon.

11:11.150 --> 11:14.100
You're just proving my point.

11:14.100 --> 11:15.900
What can you do with that toy?

11:15.900 --> 11:18.840
Either way, you know Iria's gonna come after you.

11:18.840 --> 11:21.550
Are you trying to mess with my money?

11:21.550 --> 11:23.050
You mean Iria's gonna die?

11:23.050 --> 11:24.800
That's impossible!

11:24.800 --> 11:27.540
It's not impossible, that's why
you're going alone, aren't you?

11:28.090 --> 11:29.870
Uh, I guess...

11:29.870 --> 11:31.290
But...

11:31.290 --> 11:33.000
But it's still impossible!

11:40.300 --> 11:41.470
Iria!

11:43.080 --> 11:46.090
Fujikuro, thanks for stopping Kei...

11:46.090 --> 11:47.600
...and loaning me the Dempadan.

11:48.200 --> 11:49.900
Wait, you mean...

11:49.900 --> 11:50.940
Iria...

11:50.940 --> 11:51.560
Iria!

11:51.920 --> 11:55.480
Kei, you need to stay
here until I get back!

11:55.480 --> 11:57.440
That's not fair!

11:57.440 --> 12:01.290
Start acting and speaking
like a young lady!

12:02.830 --> 12:04.030
This sucks!

12:04.030 --> 12:05.930
Why can't I go?

12:05.930 --> 12:09.370
Jesus, you're just like her, I swear.

12:09.370 --> 12:10.160
What?

12:12.900 --> 12:14.700
Forgive me Kei.

12:14.700 --> 12:17.340
We can go together when
you become an apprentice.

12:17.680 --> 12:19.800
I promise.

12:29.860 --> 12:32.060
They're both so hotheaded.

12:37.840 --> 12:40.680
<i>The master plan starts in thirty-five minutes.</i>

12:40.680 --> 12:45.360
<i>If you screw up, you’ll end up in space
along with the rest of the monsters.</i>

12:45.750 --> 12:47.390
That's if I screw up.

12:49.030 --> 12:51.680
<i>The odds are stacked against you.</i>

12:51.680 --> 12:53.160
I'm still going to do it.

12:53.920 --> 12:55.170
I've made up my mind.

12:56.430 --> 12:59.500
<i>You’re just like your brother.</i>

13:01.060 --> 13:02.420
I can't imagine why.

13:13.520 --> 13:14.940
Reporting from Team Dainin...

13:13.520 --> 13:14.940
We have five terminals in place.

13:14.940 --> 13:16.810
We can't hold them much longer.

13:14.940 --> 13:16.810
Please start the formation.

13:16.810 --> 13:19.270
The Jeranspicha are arriving at Terminal seven.

13:19.570 --> 13:21.320
Fire!

13:24.010 --> 13:26.470
Madoura, move it!

13:32.850 --> 13:35.410
Cease fire, it's too
close to the terminal!

13:37.630 --> 13:40.290
Get out of the Madouras and back us up!

13:43.310 --> 13:46.220
Terminal Three, we're ready to go!

13:47.840 --> 13:50.220
We have to protect the terminal!

13:50.220 --> 13:52.990
<i>Emergency call from Terminal seven!</i>

13:52.990 --> 13:55.280
<i>A Dempadan has entered
the teleport zone.</i>

13:55.280 --> 13:56.460
What?

13:56.460 --> 13:57.390
What is it doing there?

13:57.720 --> 13:59.750
<i>This is a warning, pull back at once!</i>

13:59.750 --> 14:01.390
<i>This is a teleport zone!</i>

14:01.390 --> 14:02.610
<i>Pull back at once.</i>

14:02.610 --> 14:03.720
<i>I repeat!</i>

14:03.720 --> 14:06.070
<i>Pull back at once!</i>

14:50.140 --> 14:50.910
Iria!

14:51.370 --> 14:52.780
Kei, Fujikuro!

14:53.100 --> 14:55.330
Hey lady, want a ride?

14:55.330 --> 14:56.500
Stop joking around!

15:04.000 --> 15:06.210
All set, confirming power supply.

15:06.260 --> 15:07.750
<i>What about the Dempadan?</i>

15:07.750 --> 15:09.600
Proceed as planned, stand by!

15:09.600 --> 15:10.800
Reinforcements are on their way.

15:11.040 --> 15:11.900
Hold your positions!

15:11.900 --> 15:13.260
Send backup to Terminal four!

15:22.000 --> 15:22.940
Fujikuro...

15:23.230 --> 15:24.410
Later.

15:24.410 --> 15:25.650
I'm getting outta this hell-hole.

15:25.980 --> 15:27.610
Thanks a lot.

15:27.970 --> 15:30.040
You'd better thank me.

15:30.040 --> 15:32.700
This brat keeps making me risk my life.

15:33.060 --> 15:34.380
Oh yeah?

15:34.380 --> 15:36.160
— What did you do?
— Nothing.

15:36.420 --> 15:40.030
I swear, you two are almost identical.

15:40.030 --> 15:43.000
Iria, baby-sitting fees
are gonna be costly.

15:43.000 --> 15:45.130
I'll have a fat bill waiting for you.

15:45.420 --> 15:48.090
Thanks, see you later.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.310
Bye, Fujikuro!

15:51.310 --> 15:53.320
Later, little punk!

15:55.800 --> 15:58.310
Watch your backs, guys.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.860
Crap.

16:01.860 --> 16:04.230
You owe me big for this one, Iria!

16:05.880 --> 16:07.570
Outta the way, you freaks!

16:09.340 --> 16:10.530
What's going on?

16:10.920 --> 16:14.970
Watch it, they're in control here.

16:25.760 --> 16:26.940
You ready?

16:26.940 --> 16:28.280
Okay!

16:35.210 --> 16:37.180
<i>Three minutes remaining.</i>

16:37.180 --> 16:39.220
Where are the reinforcements?

16:45.820 --> 16:47.060
Kei, watch out!

16:48.050 --> 16:49.160
Take this!

16:49.710 --> 16:51.070
You bastard!

16:56.960 --> 16:59.080
Kei, get ready to jump!

17:08.370 --> 17:09.630
Are you okay?

17:09.630 --> 17:11.030
Yup.

17:15.180 --> 17:17.200
What the hell is this?

17:20.790 --> 17:22.350
Kei, hang on!

17:22.350 --> 17:25.190
Iria, this... Stand it up!

17:25.400 --> 17:27.190
What is this?

17:27.190 --> 17:29.050
Just do it!

17:32.360 --> 17:34.610
I'll trust your secret weapon!

17:48.080 --> 17:49.170
Look!

17:53.490 --> 17:56.340
I was gonna seal you inside this shield!

17:58.160 --> 18:00.830
See that thing behind Zeiram?

18:00.830 --> 18:02.760
Take care of it for me!

18:03.200 --> 18:05.230
— Sure, you can count on me!
— Get ready.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.520
One minute remaining.

18:08.520 --> 18:09.600
Get confirmation!

18:09.600 --> 18:11.260
<i>Terminal one, on standby.</i>

18:11.260 --> 18:12.730
<i>Terminal three...</i>

18:12.730 --> 18:13.730
Stand back!

18:13.780 --> 18:15.440
Energy pressure confirmed!

18:15.510 --> 18:17.530
Terminal seven all clear.

18:22.480 --> 18:23.740
Let's go!

18:26.660 --> 18:28.040
Where are you looking?

18:28.040 --> 18:29.500
I'm over here.

18:31.540 --> 18:33.110
Kei!

18:40.960 --> 18:43.220
Damn it...

18:51.980 --> 18:55.070
Thirty seconds remaining, countdown
starting at ten seconds.

18:55.350 --> 18:56.470
What's this?

18:56.470 --> 18:59.530
The teleport program is getting hacked!

18:59.900 --> 19:00.880
What?

19:00.880 --> 19:02.740
It's too late! Prepare for countdown!

19:11.500 --> 19:12.710
Take this!

19:15.670 --> 19:16.880
I got it!

19:17.240 --> 19:17.840
Kei!

19:20.420 --> 19:21.640
Teleport!

19:21.640 --> 19:23.260
Fire!

19:26.140 --> 19:27.640
<i>They’re out of time!</i>

19:28.350 --> 19:29.900
What's next?

19:33.820 --> 19:35.020
What's happening?

19:35.020 --> 19:36.610
Terminal nine, report!

19:36.850 --> 19:39.570
Shoot it down, hurry!

19:44.760 --> 19:45.900
There's some left...

19:45.900 --> 19:47.490
...with him.

19:49.200 --> 19:50.790
Wow!

19:52.320 --> 19:54.090
This is awesome!

19:54.090 --> 19:55.980
— You can have it.
— Really?

19:55.980 --> 19:58.340
It only glides, though.

20:20.560 --> 20:21.860
We're ready!

20:22.270 --> 20:23.920
<i>Terminal nine, ready!</i>

20:23.920 --> 20:25.820
Twenty seconds remaining.

20:27.010 --> 20:28.290
Is this okay?

20:28.290 --> 20:29.950
Looks good.

20:29.950 --> 20:31.290
Kei.

20:33.280 --> 20:37.000
You are just like I was,
when I still had Glen.

20:37.210 --> 20:37.750
Huh?

20:38.880 --> 20:40.670
Iria!

21:37.570 --> 21:40.730
Zeiram, I'm here to
put an end to this hell!

23:17.810 --> 23:20.060
<i>Maybe Zeiram can tell me...</i>

23:20.060 --> 23:21.540
<i>What?</i>

23:21.540 --> 23:23.290
<i>His weakness.</i>

23:23.290 --> 23:27.500
<i>If I’m assimilated, maybe
I’ll understand his plan.</i>

23:27.500 --> 23:30.630
<i>If you get assimilated,
it will all be over!</i>

23:30.630 --> 23:32.760
<i>That’s only if I completely lose myself.</i>

23:35.240 --> 23:39.350
Maybe this wasn't a
bright idea after all...

23:50.610 --> 23:53.410
I'll still do the best that I can!

24:30.860 --> 24:33.040
You won't get away this time!

25:08.140 --> 25:10.680
So where am I?

25:11.070 --> 25:12.060
No...

25:12.060 --> 25:13.820
Iria!

25:14.000 --> 25:15.480
Kei!

25:22.120 --> 25:24.080
Kei, get in!

25:24.280 --> 25:25.980
What happened?

25:25.980 --> 25:27.870
— Where's Zeiram?
— He's dead!

25:27.870 --> 25:29.040
Get inside, now!

25:29.380 --> 25:31.080
All right, I will.

25:31.080 --> 25:32.970
What's the big hurry?

25:32.970 --> 25:34.820
This is the Stardust Desert.

25:34.820 --> 25:36.380
Stardust?

25:36.380 --> 25:37.960
Are you sure you're okay?

25:37.960 --> 25:39.870
We don't have time!

25:40.650 --> 25:43.810
It's almost dawn, then...

25:44.000 --> 25:46.740
— Then what?
— You'll see.

25:49.600 --> 25:51.480
Wow, cool!

25:51.690 --> 25:54.440
Don't look at the sun,
or you'll go blind!

25:55.800 --> 25:57.750
<i>Are you okay, Iria?</i>

25:57.750 --> 25:58.410
Bob!

25:58.740 --> 26:00.660
I'm not okay at all!

26:00.660 --> 26:02.870
Why the hell did you send me here?

26:03.040 --> 26:04.780
<i>Oops, sorry.</i>

26:04.780 --> 26:06.290
<i>There wasn’t much time.</i>

26:06.290 --> 26:09.330
<i>Switch to autopilot and take a long nap.</i>

26:09.660 --> 26:12.570
You've gotta be joking!

26:19.260 --> 26:20.350
What's so funny?

26:20.350 --> 26:22.040
It just is.

26:22.040 --> 26:23.310
Fine.

26:26.100 --> 26:28.620
I love you, Iria!

26:33.650 --> 26:38.920
<i>The morning to come
does not matter...</i>

26:38.920 --> 26:46.370
<i>let's go as we are now.</i>

26:52.120 --> 26:58.470
<i>We're passing a blue star...</i>

26:58.470 --> 27:04.600
<i>a tiny floating light.</i>

27:04.600 --> 27:10.990
<i>It's just the two
of us, no need to speak.</i>

27:10.990 --> 27:16.640
<i>Looking out over the city...</i>

27:16.640 --> 27:23.030
<i>The painful memories we have shared...</i>

27:23.030 --> 27:28.300
<i>they will be put to rest tonight.</i>

27:28.300 --> 27:34.880
<i>And the night to come
does not matter...</i>

27:34.880 --> 27:42.050
<i>let's go without looking back.</i>

27:42.050 --> 27:47.320
<i>Even though our dreams are far away...</i>

27:47.320 --> 27:54.770
<i>I will never let them go.</i>
